# ---- kleine Bausteine für Kacheln (WPF-Objekte)
function New-TbText([string]$Text, [double]$Size = 12, [string]$Color = '#1F2A44', [string]$Weight = 'Normal', [bool]$Wrap = $true) {
    $t = New-Object Windows.Controls.TextBlock
    $t.Text = $Text; $t.FontSize = $Size; $t.Foreground = New-UiBrush $Color; $t.FontWeight = $Weight
    if ($Wrap) { $t.TextWrapping = 'Wrap' } else { $t.TextTrimming = 'CharacterEllipsis' }
    return $t
}
function New-TbBadge([int]$Glyph, [string]$Color, [int]$Size = 40) {
    $b = New-Object Windows.Controls.Border
    $b.Width = $Size; $b.Height = $Size; $b.CornerRadius = [string][math]::Round($Size / 4); $b.Background = New-UiBrush $Color; $b.VerticalAlignment = 'Top'
    $sh = New-Object Windows.Media.Effects.DropShadowEffect; $sh.BlurRadius = 10; $sh.ShadowDepth = 2; $sh.Direction = 270; $sh.Opacity = 0.25; $sh.Color = [Windows.Media.ColorConverter]::ConvertFromString($Color)
    $b.Effect = $sh
    $g = New-Object Windows.Controls.TextBlock
    $g.FontFamily = 'Segoe MDL2 Assets'; $g.Text = [string][char]$Glyph; $g.FontSize = [math]::Round($Size * 0.45); $g.Foreground = New-UiBrush '#FFFFFF'
    $g.HorizontalAlignment = 'Center'; $g.VerticalAlignment = 'Center'
    $b.Child = $g
    return $b
}
function New-TbChip([string]$Text, [string]$Fg, [string]$Bg) {
    $b = New-Object Windows.Controls.Border
    $b.CornerRadius = '5'; $b.Padding = '7,1,7,2'; $b.Margin = '0,0,5,4'; $b.Background = New-UiBrush $Bg; $b.VerticalAlignment = 'Center'
    $t = New-Object Windows.Controls.TextBlock; $t.Text = $Text; $t.FontSize = 10.5; $t.FontWeight = 'SemiBold'; $t.Foreground = New-UiBrush $Fg
    $b.Child = $t
    return $b
}
function New-TbButton([string]$Text, [string]$Tag, [bool]$Primary, [int]$Glyph = 0) {
    $b = New-Object Windows.Controls.Button
    if (-not $Primary) { $b.Style = $window.FindResource('Sec') }
    $b.Tag = $Tag; $b.Padding = '10,5'; $b.FontSize = 12.5
    $sp = New-Object Windows.Controls.StackPanel; $sp.Orientation = 'Horizontal'
    $gl = New-Object Windows.Controls.TextBlock; $gl.FontFamily = 'Segoe MDL2 Assets'; $gl.FontSize = 12; $gl.VerticalAlignment = 'Center'
    $gl.Text = $(if ($Glyph) { [string][char]$Glyph } else { '' }); $gl.Visibility = $(if ($Glyph) { 'Visible' } else { 'Collapsed' })
    $tx = New-Object Windows.Controls.TextBlock; $tx.Text = $Text; $tx.VerticalAlignment = 'Center'
    $tx.Margin = $(if ($Glyph -and $Text) { '6,0,0,0' } else { '0' }); $tx.Visibility = $(if ($Text) { 'Visible' } else { 'Collapsed' })
    [void]$sp.Children.Add($gl); [void]$sp.Children.Add($tx)
    $b.Content = $sp
    return $b
}
function Set-TbButtonPrimary($Btn, [bool]$Primary) { if ($Primary) { $Btn.Style = $null } else { $Btn.Style = $window.FindResource('Sec') } }
function New-TbShadow {
    $e = New-Object Windows.Media.Effects.DropShadowEffect
    $e.BlurRadius = 16; $e.ShadowDepth = 2; $e.Direction = 270; $e.Opacity = 0.07; $e.Color = [Windows.Media.Colors]::Black
    return $e
}
function Format-TbSize([int64]$Bytes) {
    if ($Bytes -ge 1GB) { return ('{0:N2} GB' -f ($Bytes / 1GB)) }
    if ($Bytes -ge 1MB) { return ('{0:N0} MB' -f ($Bytes / 1MB)) }
    if ($Bytes -gt 0) { return ('{0:N0} KB' -f ($Bytes / 1KB)) }
    return '0 MB'
}
function Get-TbDateKey($D) { if ($D -is [datetime]) { return $D.ToString('s') }; return [string]$D }
function Get-TbSourceLabel($T) {
    switch ([string]$T.Kind) {
        'GitHub' { return ('GitHub: ' + $T.Repo) }
        'Winget' { return ('winget: ' + $T.WingetId) }
        default {
            $u = if ($T.Urls) { @($T.Urls)[0] } else { @($T.Pages)[0] }
            $h = ([uri]$u).Host -replace '^(www|download)\.', ''
            if ($h -match 'sysinternals') { return 'Microsoft Sysinternals' }
            if ($h -match 'nirsoft') { return 'NirSoft' }
            return $h
        }
    }
}
# PE-Kopf lesen: 2 = Programm mit Fenster, 3 = Kommandozeile
function Get-TbPeSubsystem([string]$File) {
    try {
        $fs = [IO.File]::Open($File, 'Open', 'Read', 'ReadWrite')
        try {
            $br = New-Object IO.BinaryReader($fs)
            $fs.Position = 0x3C; $pe = $br.ReadInt32()
            if ($pe -le 0 -or $pe -gt ($fs.Length - 96)) { return 0 }
            $fs.Position = $pe; if ($br.ReadUInt32() -ne 0x4550) { return 0 }
            $fs.Position = $pe + 0x5C
            return [int]$br.ReadUInt16()
        } finally { $fs.Dispose() }
    } catch { return 0 }
}

# ---- Installationsstatus (winget export + "Programme und Features") - gemeinsam für Toolbox und Kiosk
function Get-KsInstallState([string]$Wg) {
    $ids = [System.Collections.Generic.List[string]]::new(); $wgOk = $false
    if ($Wg) {
        $tmp = Join-Path $env:TEMP ('pctools-kiosk-{0}.json' -f [guid]::NewGuid().ToString('N'))
        try {
            $null = Invoke-NdCmd $Wg ('export -o "{0}" --accept-source-agreements --disable-interactivity' -f $tmp) 180
            if (Test-Path -LiteralPath $tmp) {
                $j = Get-Content -LiteralPath $tmp -Raw -Encoding UTF8 | ConvertFrom-Json
                foreach ($src in @($j.Sources)) { foreach ($pk in @($src.Packages)) { if ($pk.PackageIdentifier) { $ids.Add([string]$pk.PackageIdentifier) } } }
                $wgOk = $true
            }
        } catch { } finally { Remove-Item -LiteralPath $tmp -Force -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue }
    }
    $keys = 'HKLM:\SOFTWARE\Microsoft\Windows\CurrentVersion\Uninstall\*', 'HKLM:\SOFTWARE\WOW6432Node\Microsoft\Windows\CurrentVersion\Uninstall\*', 'HKCU:\SOFTWARE\Microsoft\Windows\CurrentVersion\Uninstall\*'
    $arp = @(Get-ItemProperty $keys -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue | Where-Object { $_.DisplayName } | ForEach-Object { [pscustomobject]@{ N = [string]$_.DisplayName; V = [string]$_.DisplayVersion; Icon = [string]$_.DisplayIcon; Loc = [string]$_.InstallLocation } })
    $c2r = Get-ItemProperty 'HKLM:\SOFTWARE\Microsoft\Office\ClickToRun\Configuration' -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue
    [pscustomobject]@{ Ids = @($ids); Arp = $arp; Office = [bool]($c2r -and $c2r.ProductReleaseIds); Winget = $wgOk }
}
# $true / $false, $null = noch unbekannt
function Test-KsInstalled([string]$Id, [string]$Arp) {
    $st = $script:KsState
    if (-not $st) { return $null }
    if ($Id -eq 'Microsoft.Office') { return [bool]$st.Office }
    if ($Id -and $st.Ids.Contains($Id)) { return $true }
    if ($Arp) { foreach ($a in $st.Arp) { if ($a.N -match $Arp) { return $true } } }
    return $false
}
function Get-KsArpMatch([string]$Arp) {
    if (-not $Arp -or -not $script:KsState) { return $null }
    foreach ($a in $script:KsState.Arp) { if ($a.N -match $Arp) { return $a } }
    return $null
}
function Start-KsStateScan {
    if ($script:KsScanBusy) { return }
    $script:KsScanBusy = $true
    if ($script:KsBuilt) { $ui.KsStatus.Text = 'Installierte Programme werden ermittelt (winget und "Programme und Features") - das dauert einige Sekunden ...' }
    Invoke-Bg -Script { param($wg) Get-KsInstallState $wg } -Arguments @((Get-WingetPathX)) -Functions @('Get-KsInstallState', 'Invoke-NdCmd') -Done {
        param($r, $err)
        $script:KsScanBusy = $false
        $st = @($r | Where-Object { $_ -and $_.PSObject.Properties['Arp'] }) | Select-Object -Last 1
        if ($err -or -not $st) {
            if ($script:KsBuilt) { $ui.KsStatus.Text = 'Installationsstatus nicht ermittelbar: ' + $(if ($err) { $err.Message } else { 'keine Daten' }) }
            return
        }
        $set = New-Object 'System.Collections.Generic.HashSet[string]' ([StringComparer]::OrdinalIgnoreCase)
        foreach ($i in @($st.Ids)) { [void]$set.Add([string]$i) }
        $script:KsState = @{ Ids = $set; Arp = @($st.Arp); Office = [bool]$st.Office; Winget = [bool]$st.Winget; Time = Get-Date }
        try { Update-KsAll } catch { $ui.StatusText.Text = 'Software-Kiosk: ' + $_.Exception.Message }
        try { Update-TbView } catch { $ui.StatusText.Text = 'Toolbox: ' + $_.Exception.Message }
    }
}

# =====================================================================
#  TOOLBOX
# =====================================================================
function New-TbTile($T) {
    $card = New-Object Windows.Controls.Border
    $card.Width = 246; $card.Height = 258; $card.Margin = '0,0,14,14'; $card.Padding = '16,14,16,14'; $card.CornerRadius = '14'
    $card.Background = New-UiBrush 'White'; $card.BorderBrush = New-UiBrush '#E2E7F0'; $card.BorderThickness = '1'; $card.Effect = New-TbShadow
    $src = Get-TbSourceLabel $T
    $card.ToolTip = ('{0}{4}{1}{4}{4}Quelle: {2}{4}Portabel: {3}' -f $T.Name, $T.Desc, $src, $(if ($T.Portable) { 'ja - läuft ohne Installation, auch vom USB-Stick' } else { 'nein - wird per winget auf dem PC installiert' }), "`n")
    $card.Tag = $T.Key
    $g = New-Object Windows.Controls.Grid
    foreach ($h in 'Auto', 'Auto', '*', 'Auto', 'Auto') { $rd = New-Object Windows.Controls.RowDefinition; $rd.Height = $h; [void]$g.RowDefinitions.Add($rd) }
    # Kopf: Symbol, Name, Quelle
    $hd = New-Object Windows.Controls.Grid
    foreach ($w in 'Auto', '*') { $cd = New-Object Windows.Controls.ColumnDefinition; $cd.Width = $w; [void]$hd.ColumnDefinitions.Add($cd) }
    $bdg = New-TbBadge $T.Glyph $T.Color 42; $bdg.Margin = '0,0,12,0'
    $ns = New-Object Windows.Controls.StackPanel; $ns.VerticalAlignment = 'Center'; [Windows.Controls.Grid]::SetColumn($ns, 1)
    [void]$ns.Children.Add((New-TbText $T.Name 15 '#1F2A44' 'SemiBold' $false))
    $sl = New-TbText $src 11 '#6B7890' 'Normal' $false; $sl.Margin = '0,1,0,0'; [void]$ns.Children.Add($sl)
    [void]$hd.Children.Add($bdg); [void]$hd.Children.Add($ns)
    # Chips
    $chips = New-Object Windows.Controls.WrapPanel; $chips.Margin = '0,10,0,0'; [Windows.Controls.Grid]::SetRow($chips, 1)
    [void]$chips.Children.Add((New-TbChip $T.Cat $TbCatColor[$T.Cat] $TbCatBg[$T.Cat]))
    if ($T.Portable) { [void]$chips.Children.Add((New-TbChip 'portabel' '#15803D' '#DCFCE7')) } else { [void]$chips.Children.Add((New-TbChip 'winget' '#6D4AE8' '#EDE9FE')) }
    if ([string]$T.Args -match 'accepteula') { [void]$chips.Children.Add((New-TbChip 'Microsoft' '#2563EB' '#F5F9FF')) }
    # Beschreibung
    $ds = New-TbText $T.Desc 12 '#475569'; $ds.TextTrimming = 'WordEllipsis'; $ds.Margin = '0,4,0,0'; $ds.LineHeight = 16.5
    [Windows.Controls.Grid]::SetRow($ds, 2)
    # Status
    $sg = New-Object Windows.Controls.Grid; $sg.Margin = '0,8,0,10'; [Windows.Controls.Grid]::SetRow($sg, 3)
    foreach ($w in 'Auto', '*') { $cd = New-Object Windows.Controls.ColumnDefinition; $cd.Width = $w; [void]$sg.ColumnDefinitions.Add($cd) }
    $dot = New-Object Windows.Shapes.Ellipse; $dot.Width = 8; $dot.Height = 8; $dot.Fill = New-UiBrush '#9AA5B8'; $dot.Margin = '0,5,8,0'; $dot.VerticalAlignment = 'Top'
    $st = New-TbText 'wird geprüft ...' 11.5 '#6B7890'; [Windows.Controls.Grid]::SetColumn($st, 1); $st.MaxHeight = 32; $st.TextTrimming = 'CharacterEllipsis'
    [void]$sg.Children.Add($dot); [void]$sg.Children.Add($st)
    # Knöpfe
    $bg = New-Object Windows.Controls.Grid; [Windows.Controls.Grid]::SetRow($bg, 4)
    foreach ($w in '*', 'Auto', 'Auto') { $cd = New-Object Windows.Controls.ColumnDefinition; $cd.Width = $w; [void]$bg.ColumnDefinitions.Add($cd) }
    $bs = New-TbButton 'Starten' $T.Key $false 0xE768; $bs.Margin = '0,0,6,0'; $bs.ToolTip = ('{0} starten' -f $T.Name)
    $bl = New-TbButton 'Laden' $T.Key $false 0xE896; $bl.Margin = '0,0,6,0'; [Windows.Controls.Grid]::SetColumn($bl, 1)
    $bl.ToolTip = $(if ($T.Portable) { 'Neueste Version vom Hersteller laden bzw. aktualisieren' } else { 'Über winget installieren bzw. aktualisieren' })
    $bd = New-TbButton '' $T.Key $false 0xE838; $bd.ToolTip = 'Ordner öffnen'; $bd.Padding = '9,5'; [Windows.Controls.Grid]::SetColumn($bd, 2)
    $bs.Add_Click({ param($sender, $e) Start-TbTool ([string]$sender.Tag) $sender })
    $bl.Add_Click({ param($sender, $e) Start-TbLoadOne ([string]$sender.Tag) })
    $bd.Add_Click({ param($sender, $e) Open-TbFolder ([string]$sender.Tag) })
    [void]$bg.Children.Add($bs); [void]$bg.Children.Add($bl); [void]$bg.Children.Add($bd)
    foreach ($c in $hd, $chips, $ds, $sg, $bg) { [void]$g.Children.Add($c) }
    $card.Child = $g
    $card.Add_MouseEnter({ param($sender, $e) $sender.BorderBrush = New-UiBrush '#AFC4EA' })
    $card.Add_MouseLeave({ param($sender, $e) $sender.BorderBrush = New-UiBrush '#E2E7F0' })
    return [pscustomobject]@{ Tool = $T; Card = $card; Dot = $dot; Status = $st; Start = $bs; Load = $bl; Dir = $bd }
}
function Build-TbTiles {
    $ui.TbPanel.Children.Clear(); $script:TbTiles = @{}; $script:TbSections = @{}
    foreach ($cat in $TbCategories) {
        $tools = @($TbCatalog | Where-Object { $_.Cat -eq $cat })
        if (-not $tools.Count) { continue }
        $sec = New-Object Windows.Controls.StackPanel; $sec.Margin = '0,6,0,4'
        $hd = New-Object Windows.Controls.StackPanel; $hd.Orientation = 'Horizontal'; $hd.Margin = '2,0,0,12'
        $bar = New-Object Windows.Controls.Border; $bar.Width = 4; $bar.Height = 18; $bar.CornerRadius = '2'; $bar.Background = New-UiBrush $TbCatColor[$cat]; $bar.Margin = '0,0,10,0'; $bar.VerticalAlignment = 'Center'
        $ht = New-TbText $cat 17 '#1F2A44' 'SemiBold' $false
        $hc = New-TbText ('{0} Werkzeuge' -f $tools.Count) 12 '#6B7890' 'Normal' $false; $hc.Margin = '10,0,0,0'; $hc.VerticalAlignment = 'Center'
        [void]$hd.Children.Add($bar); [void]$hd.Children.Add($ht); [void]$hd.Children.Add($hc)
        $wrap = New-Object Windows.Controls.WrapPanel
        foreach ($tool in $tools) { $tile = New-TbTile $tool; $script:TbTiles[$tool.Key] = $tile; [void]$wrap.Children.Add($tile.Card) }
        [void]$sec.Children.Add($hd); [void]$sec.Children.Add($wrap)
        [void]$ui.TbPanel.Children.Add($sec)
        $script:TbSections[$cat] = [pscustomobject]@{ Panel = $sec; Count = $hc; Total = $tools.Count }
    }
    $script:TbBuilt = $true
}
function Update-TbView {
    if (-not $script:TbBuilt) { return }
    $dir = Get-TbDir
    $ui.TbPath.Text = ('Speicherort: {0}{1}' -f $dir, $(if ($Script:IsPortable) { '  (PC-Tools läuft portabel - die Toolbox liegt auf dem Stick)' } else { '  - mit "Auf USB-Stick kopieren" überall dabei' }))
    $loaded = 0; $portTotal = 0; $wgInst = 0; $wgTotal = 0; $upd = 0
    foreach ($key in @($script:TbTiles.Keys)) {
        $tile = $script:TbTiles[$key]; $tl = $tile.Tool
        $meta = Read-TbMeta $dir $tl.Key; $script:TbMeta[$tl.Key] = $meta
        $dotC = '#9AA5B8'; $txt = ''; $can = $false
        if ($tl.Kind -eq 'Winget') {
            $wgTotal++
            $inst = Test-KsInstalled $tl.WingetId $tl.Arp
            if ($null -eq $inst) { $txt = 'Installationsstatus wird ermittelt ...' }
            elseif ($inst) {
                $wgInst++; $can = $true; $dotC = '#16A34A'
                $a = Get-KsArpMatch $tl.Arp
                $txt = 'installiert via winget' + $(if ($a -and $a.V) { ' - Version ' + $a.V } else { '' })
            } else { $txt = 'nicht installiert - keine portable Version, Installation über winget' }
            $tile.Load.Content.Children[1].Text = $(if ($inst) { 'Aktualisieren' } else { 'Installieren' })
        } else {
            $portTotal++
            $ok = $false
            if ($meta) {
                if ($tl.Menu -and -not $meta.Exe) { $ok = Test-Path -LiteralPath (Join-Path $dir $tl.Key) }
                elseif ($meta.Exe) { $ok = Test-Path -LiteralPath (Join-Path (Join-Path $dir $tl.Key) ([string]$meta.Exe)) }
            }
            if ($ok) {
                $loaded++; $can = $true; $dotC = '#16A34A'
                $dd = ''; try { $dd = ([datetime]$meta.Date).ToString('dd.MM.yyyy') } catch { }
                $txt = ('Version {0} - geladen am {1}' -f $(if ($meta.Version) { $meta.Version } else { '?' }), $dd)
                $u = $script:TbUpdates[$tl.Key]
                if ($u -and ([string]$u.Date -eq (Get-TbDateKey $meta.Date))) { $upd++; $dotC = '#EA580C'; $txt = ('Update verfügbar: {0} (geladen: {1})' -f $u.Version, $(if ($meta.Version) { $meta.Version } else { $dd })) }
            } else { $txt = 'nicht geladen' }
            $tile.Load.Content.Children[1].Text = $(if ($ok) { 'Aktualisieren' } else { 'Laden' })
        }
        $tile.Status.Text = $txt
        $tile.Status.Foreground = New-UiBrush $(if ($dotC -eq '#EA580C') { '#EA580C' } else { '#6B7890' })
        $tile.Dot.Fill = New-UiBrush $dotC
        $tile.Start.IsEnabled = $can
        Set-TbButtonPrimary $tile.Start $can
        Set-TbButtonPrimary $tile.Load ((-not $can) -or ($dotC -eq '#EA580C'))
    }
    $ui.TbStatLoaded.Text = ('{0} / {1}' -f $loaded, $portTotal)
    $ui.TbStatUpd.Text = $(if ($script:TbChecked) { [string]$upd } else { '?' })
    $ui.TbStatWg.Text = $(if ($script:KsState) { '{0} / {1}' -f $wgInst, $wgTotal } else { '...' })
    $ui.TbStatSize.Text = $(if ($script:TbSizeBytes -ge 0) { Format-TbSize $script:TbSizeBytes } else { '...' })
    if (-not $script:TbChecking) {
        $ui.TbInfo.Text = $(if ($script:TbChecked) { 'Zuletzt nach Updates gesucht: {0}{1}' -f $script:TbChecked, $(if ($upd) { (' - {0} Werkzeug(e) mit neuer Version, orange markiert. "Alle laden/aktualisieren" holt nur die neuen.' -f $upd) } else { ' - alles aktuell.' }) } elseif ($loaded) { 'Tipp: "Nach Updates suchen" prüft beim Hersteller, ob es neue Versionen gibt.' } else { 'Noch keine Werkzeuge geladen - "Alle laden/aktualisieren" holt alle portablen Werkzeuge (ca. 250 MB), einzelne über "Laden" auf der Kachel.' })
    }
    Update-TbFilter
}
function Update-TbFilter {
    if (-not $script:TbBuilt) { return }
    $catSel = if ($ui.TbCat.SelectedIndex -gt 0) { [string]$ui.TbCat.SelectedItem.Content } else { '' }
    $q = $ui.TbSearch.Text.Trim()
    $vis = @{}
    foreach ($key in @($script:TbTiles.Keys)) {
        $tile = $script:TbTiles[$key]; $tl = $tile.Tool
        $show = ((-not $catSel) -or ($tl.Cat -eq $catSel)) -and ((-not $q) -or (Test-Match $tl $q @('Name', 'Desc', 'Cat', 'Key', 'WingetId', 'Repo')))
        $tile.Card.Visibility = $(if ($show) { 'Visible' } else { 'Collapsed' })
        if ($show) { $vis[$tl.Cat] = 1 + [int]$vis[$tl.Cat] }
    }
    foreach ($c in @($script:TbSections.Keys)) {
        $s = $script:TbSections[$c]
        $s.Panel.Visibility = $(if ($vis[$c]) { 'Visible' } else { 'Collapsed' })
        $s.Count.Text = $(if ([int]$vis[$c] -lt $s.Total) { '{0} von {1} Werkzeugen' -f [int]$vis[$c], $s.Total } else { '{0} Werkzeuge' -f $s.Total })
    }
}
function Read-TbUpdateCache {
    $script:TbUpdates = @{}; $script:TbChecked = ''
    $f = Join-Path (Get-TbDir) 'updates.json'
    if (-not (Test-Path -LiteralPath $f)) { return }
    try {
        $j = Get-Content -LiteralPath $f -Raw -Encoding UTF8 | ConvertFrom-Json
        $script:TbChecked = [string]$j.Checked
        foreach ($it in @($j.Items)) { if ($it.Key) { $script:TbUpdates[[string]$it.Key] = @{ Version = [string]$it.Version; Date = (Get-TbDateKey $it.Date) } } }
    } catch { }
}
function Save-TbUpdateCache {
    $d = Get-TbDir
    if (-not (Test-Path -LiteralPath $d)) { return }
    try {
        $items = @(foreach ($k in $script:TbUpdates.Keys) { [ordered]@{ Key = $k; Version = $script:TbUpdates[$k].Version; Date = $script:TbUpdates[$k].Date } })
        ([ordered]@{ Checked = $script:TbChecked; Items = $items } | ConvertTo-Json -Depth 4) | Set-Content -LiteralPath (Join-Path $d 'updates.json') -Encoding UTF8
    } catch { }
}
function Start-TbSizeScan {
    Invoke-Bg -Script {
        param($d)
        $sum = [int64]0
        if (Test-Path -LiteralPath $d) { foreach ($f in (Get-ChildItem -LiteralPath $d -Recurse -File -Force -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue)) { $sum += $f.Length } }
        $sum
    } -Arguments @((Get-TbDir)) -Done {
        param($r, $err)
        $script:TbSizeBytes = $(if ($err -or -not $r) { [int64]0 } else { [int64](@($r)[-1]) })
        if ($script:TbBuilt) { $ui.TbStatSize.Text = Format-TbSize $script:TbSizeBytes }
    }
}
function Find-TbInstalledExe($T) {
    foreach ($p in @($T.Paths)) {
        if (-not $p) { continue }
        $x = [Environment]::ExpandEnvironmentVariables([string]$p)
        $hit = @(Resolve-Path -Path $x -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue | Select-Object -First 1)
        if ($hit.Count) { return $hit[0].ProviderPath }
    }
    $a = Get-KsArpMatch $T.Arp
    if ($a) {
        $ic = (([string]$a.Icon) -split ',')[0].Trim().Trim('"')
        if ($ic -match '\.exe$' -and (Test-Path -LiteralPath $ic)) { return $ic }
        if ($a.Loc -and (Test-Path -LiteralPath $a.Loc)) {
            $e = @(Get-ChildItem -LiteralPath $a.Loc -Filter *.exe -File -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue | Where-Object { $_.Name -notmatch 'unins|setup|update' } | Sort-Object Length -Descending | Select-Object -First 1)
            if ($e.Count) { return $e[0].FullName }
        }
    }
    return ''
}
function Set-TbEula($T) {
    try {
        $base = 'HKCU:\Software\Sysinternals'
        if (-not (Test-Path $base)) { New-Item -Path $base -Force | Out-Null }
        New-ItemProperty -Path $base -Name 'EulaAccepted' -Value 1 -PropertyType DWord -Force | Out-Null
        if ($T -and $T.Eula) {
            $k = Join-Path $base $T.Eula
            if (-not (Test-Path -LiteralPath $k)) { New-Item -Path $k -Force | Out-Null }
            New-ItemProperty -LiteralPath $k -Name 'EulaAccepted' -Value 1 -PropertyType DWord -Force | Out-Null
        }
    } catch { }
}
function Start-TbExe([string]$Exe, [string]$ArgLine) {
    try {
        $sp = @{ FilePath = $Exe; WorkingDirectory = (Split-Path $Exe) }
        if ($ArgLine) { $sp.ArgumentList = $ArgLine }
        Start-Process @sp
        $ui.StatusText.Text = ('{0} gestartet' -f [IO.Path]::GetFileNameWithoutExtension($Exe))
    } catch { Show-UiError ('{0} konnte nicht gestartet werden: {1}' -f (Split-Path $Exe -Leaf), $_.Exception.Message) }
}
function Start-TbTool([string]$Key, $Btn) {
    $tl = Get-TbTool $Key; if (-not $tl) { return }
    try {
        if ($tl.Kind -eq 'Winget') {
            $exe = Find-TbInstalledExe $tl
            if (-not $exe) { Show-UiError ('Die Programmdatei von {0} wurde nicht gefunden - bitte über das Startmenü öffnen oder mit "Aktualisieren" neu installieren.' -f $tl.Name); return }
            Start-TbExe $exe ''
            return
        }
        $dir = Get-TbDir
        $meta = Read-TbMeta $dir $tl.Key
        if (-not $meta) { if (Confirm-Ui ('{0} ist noch nicht geladen. Jetzt die neueste Version vom Hersteller laden?' -f $tl.Name)) { Start-TbLoad @($tl.Key) $false }; return }
        $home2 = Join-Path $dir $tl.Key
        if ($tl.Menu) { Show-TbSuiteMenu $tl $home2 $Btn; return }
        $exe = Join-Path $home2 ([string]$meta.Exe)
        if (-not (Test-Path -LiteralPath $exe)) { Show-UiError ('Die Programmdatei fehlt ({0}) - bitte mit "Aktualisieren" neu laden. Hat ein Virenscanner sie entfernt?' -f $exe); return }
        if ([string]$tl.Args -match 'accepteula') { Set-TbEula $tl }
        Start-TbExe $exe ([string]$tl.Args)
    } catch { Show-UiError ('{0}: {1}' -f $tl.Name, $_.Exception.Message) }
}
function Show-TbSuiteMenu($T, [string]$Dir, $Btn) {
    $files = @(Get-ChildItem -LiteralPath $Dir -Filter *.exe -File -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue)
    $names = @{}; foreach ($f in $files) { $names[$f.Name.ToLower()] = $true }
    $cm = New-Object Windows.Controls.ContextMenu; $cm.MaxHeight = 560
    $mi = New-Object Windows.Controls.MenuItem; $mi.Header = (New-TbText 'Ordner öffnen' 13 '#1F2A44' 'SemiBold' $false); $mi.Tag = $Dir
    $mi.Add_Click({ param($sender, $e) Start-Process explorer.exe ('"{0}"' -f [string]$sender.Tag) }); [void]$cm.Items.Add($mi)
    $mi = New-Object Windows.Controls.MenuItem; $mi.Header = (New-TbText 'Eingabeaufforderung hier (PsExec, Sigcheck, Handle, PsInfo ...)' 13 '#1F2A44' 'SemiBold' $false); $mi.Tag = $Dir
    $mi.Add_Click({ param($sender, $e) Set-TbEula $null; Start-Process cmd.exe -ArgumentList ('/k title Sysinternals Suite & cd /d "{0}" & echo Kommandozeilen-Werkzeuge der Sysinternals Suite - z.B. psinfo, sigcheck -u -e C:\Windows\System32, handle, du, pslist' -f [string]$sender.Tag) -WorkingDirectory ([string]$sender.Tag) }); [void]$cm.Items.Add($mi)
    [void]$cm.Items.Add((New-Object Windows.Controls.Separator))
    $n = 0
    foreach ($f in ($files | Sort-Object Name)) {
        $lo = $f.Name.ToLower()
        if ($lo -match '64a\.exe$') { continue }
        if ($lo -notmatch '64\.exe$' -and $names.ContainsKey(($lo -replace '\.exe$', '64.exe'))) { continue }
        if ((Get-TbPeSubsystem $f.FullName) -ne 2) { continue }
        $desc = ''; try { $desc = ([string]$f.VersionInfo.FileDescription).Trim() -replace '^Sysinternals\s+', '' } catch { }
        $mi = New-Object Windows.Controls.MenuItem
        $mi.Header = (New-TbText $(if ($desc) { '{0}   ({1})' -f $desc, $f.Name } else { $f.Name }) 13 '#1F2A44' 'Normal' $false)
        $mi.Tag = $f.FullName
        $mi.Add_Click({ param($sender, $e) Set-TbEula $null; Start-TbExe ([string]$sender.Tag) '/accepteula' })
        [void]$cm.Items.Add($mi); $n++
    }
    if (-not $n) { Start-Process explorer.exe ('"{0}"' -f $Dir); return }
    if ($Btn) { $cm.PlacementTarget = $Btn; $cm.Placement = 'Bottom' }
    $cm.IsOpen = $true
}
function Open-TbFolder([string]$Key) {
    $tl = Get-TbTool $Key; if (-not $tl) { return }
    try {
        if ($tl.Kind -eq 'Winget') {
            $exe = Find-TbInstalledExe $tl
            if ($exe) { Start-Process explorer.exe ('/select,"{0}"' -f $exe) } else { Show-UiError ('{0} ist auf diesem PC nicht installiert.' -f $tl.Name) }
            return
        }
        $d = Join-Path (Get-TbDir) $tl.Key
        if (-not (Test-Path -LiteralPath $d)) { Show-UiError ('{0} ist noch nicht geladen.' -f $tl.Name); return }
        $meta = Read-TbMeta (Get-TbDir) $tl.Key
        if ($meta -and $meta.Exe -and (Test-Path -LiteralPath (Join-Path $d ([string]$meta.Exe)))) { Start-Process explorer.exe ('/select,"{0}"' -f (Join-Path $d ([string]$meta.Exe))) }
        else { Start-Process explorer.exe ('"{0}"' -f $d) }
    } catch { Show-UiError $_.Exception.Message }
}
function Start-TbLoad([string[]]$Keys, [bool]$Force) {
    if ($script:Job) { Show-UiError 'Es läuft bereits eine Aufgabe - bitte warten, bis sie fertig ist (Fortschritt auf der Seite Protokoll).'; return }
    if (-not @($Keys).Count) { return }
    $script:TbJobWatch = $true
    Start-Run -Parts @('ToolboxLoad') -Job @{ Tools = @($Keys); Force = $Force }
}
function Start-TbLoadOne([string]$Key) {
    $tl = Get-TbTool $Key; if (-not $tl) { return }
    if ($tl.Kind -eq 'Winget') {
        if (-not (Get-WingetPathX)) { Show-UiError 'winget (App-Installer) wurde nicht gefunden - bitte den App-Installer aus dem Microsoft Store installieren.'; return }
        if (-not (Confirm-Ui ("{0} gibt es nicht als portable Version. Es wird über winget auf diesem PC installiert bzw. aktualisiert{1}.`n`nFortfahren?" -f $tl.Name, $(if ($Script:IsPortable) { ' (nicht auf dem USB-Stick)' } else { '' })))) { return }
    }
    Start-TbLoad @($Key) $false
}
function Start-TbLoadAll {
    $port = @($TbCatalog | Where-Object { $_.Kind -ne 'Winget' } | ForEach-Object { $_.Key })
    $wgT = @($TbCatalog | Where-Object { $_.Kind -eq 'Winget' })
    $keys = @($port)
    if ($wgT.Count -and (Get-WingetPathX)) {
        $miss = @($wgT | Where-Object { (Test-KsInstalled $_.WingetId $_.Arp) -ne $true } | ForEach-Object { $_.Name })
        $msg = ("Alle {0} portablen Werkzeuge laden bzw. aktualisieren? Bereits aktuelle werden übersprungen.`n`nSollen zusätzlich die {1} Programme ohne portable Version per winget auf diesem PC installiert bzw. aktualisiert werden?`n{2}{3}`n`nJa = portable Werkzeuge und winget-Programme`nNein = nur portable Werkzeuge" -f $port.Count, $wgT.Count, (($wgT | ForEach-Object { '  - ' + $_.Name }) -join "`n"), $(if ($miss.Count) { "`n(noch nicht installiert: " + ($miss -join ', ') + ')' } else { '' }))
        $ans = [Windows.MessageBox]::Show((T ($msg)), (T ('PC-Tools - Toolbox')), 'YesNoCancel', 'Question')
        if ($ans -eq 'Cancel') { return }
        if ($ans -eq 'Yes') { $keys += @($wgT | ForEach-Object { $_.Key }) }
    } elseif (-not (Confirm-Ui ('Alle {0} portablen Werkzeuge laden bzw. aktualisieren? Bereits aktuelle werden übersprungen.' -f $port.Count))) { return }
    Start-TbLoad $keys $false
}
function Start-TbUpdateCheck {
    if ($script:TbChecking) { return }
    $dir = Get-TbDir
    $tools = @($TbCatalog | Where-Object { $_.Kind -ne 'Winget' -and (Read-TbMeta $dir $_.Key) })
    if (-not $tools.Count) { Show-UiError 'Es sind noch keine Werkzeuge geladen - "Alle laden/aktualisieren" holt gleich die neuesten Versionen.'; return }
    $script:TbChecking = $true; $ui.BtnTbCheck.IsEnabled = $false
    $ui.TbInfo.Text = ('Frage bei den Herstellern nach neuen Versionen ({0} Werkzeuge) ...' -f $tools.Count)
    Invoke-Bg -Script {
        param($list)
        foreach ($tool in $list) {
            try { [pscustomobject]@{ Key = $tool.Key; Info = (Get-TbRemoteInfo $tool); Err = '' } }
            catch { [pscustomobject]@{ Key = $tool.Key; Info = $null; Err = $_.Exception.Message } }
        }
    } -Arguments @(, $tools) -Functions @('Get-TbRemoteInfo', 'Get-WebHtml') -Done {
        param($r, $err)
        $script:TbChecking = $false; $ui.BtnTbCheck.IsEnabled = $true
        if ($err) { $ui.TbInfo.Text = 'Update-Suche fehlgeschlagen: ' + $err.Message; return }
        $script:TbUpdates = @{}; $fails = [System.Collections.Generic.List[string]]::new()
        foreach ($x in @($r)) {
            if (-not $x -or -not $x.PSObject.Properties['Key']) { continue }
            $tl = Get-TbTool ([string]$x.Key)
            if ($x.Err) { $fails.Add(('{0} ({1})' -f $tl.Name, $x.Err)); continue }
            $meta = $script:TbMeta[[string]$x.Key]
            if (-not $meta) { $meta = Read-TbMeta (Get-TbDir) ([string]$x.Key) }
            if ($meta -and (Test-TbNewer $meta $x.Info)) {
                $v = [string]$x.Info.Version
                if (-not $v -and $x.Info.LastModified) { try { $v = 'Datei vom ' + ([datetime]::Parse([string]$x.Info.LastModified)).ToString('dd.MM.yyyy') } catch { $v = 'neue Datei' } }
                if (-not $v) { $v = 'neue Datei' }
                $script:TbUpdates[[string]$x.Key] = @{ Version = $v; Date = (Get-TbDateKey $meta.Date) }
            }
        }
        $script:TbChecked = (Get-Date).ToString('dd.MM.yyyy HH:mm')
        Save-TbUpdateCache
        Update-TbView
        if ($fails.Count) { $ui.TbInfo.Text = $ui.TbInfo.Text + ('  Nicht prüfbar: {0}' -f ($fails -join '; ')) }
        $ui.StatusText.Text = ('Toolbox: {0} Update(s) gefunden' -f $script:TbUpdates.Count)
    }
}
function Start-TbUsbCopy {
    if ($script:Job) { Show-UiError 'Es läuft bereits eine Aufgabe - bitte warten.'; return }
    $src = Get-TbDir
    if (-not (Test-Path -LiteralPath $src) -or -not @(Get-ChildItem -LiteralPath $src -Directory -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue | Where-Object { $_.Name -notmatch '^_(neu|alt)_' }).Count) { Show-UiError 'Die Toolbox ist noch leer - bitte zuerst Werkzeuge laden ("Alle laden/aktualisieren").'; return }
    $items = @(Get-CimInstance Win32_LogicalDisk -Filter 'DriveType=2' -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue | ForEach-Object { '{0}\   {1}  ({2:N1} GB frei)' -f $_.DeviceID, $(if ($_.VolumeName) { $_.VolumeName } else { 'Wechseldatenträger' }), ($_.FreeSpace / 1GB) })
    $items += 'Anderen Ordner oder Laufwerk wählen ...'
    $in = Show-InputDialog 'Toolbox auf USB-Stick kopieren' ("Die Toolbox ({0}) wird neben die portablen PC-Tools kopiert: <Ziel>\PCPflege\Daten\Toolbox. Am anderen PC ""PC-Tools starten.cmd"" auf dem Stick öffnen - die Werkzeuge sind dann auf der Seite Toolbox sofort da.`n`nEin vorhandener Toolbox-Ordner auf dem Ziel wird angeglichen (Spiegelung)." -f $(if ($script:TbSizeBytes -gt 0) { Format-TbSize $script:TbSizeBytes } else { 'Größe wird ermittelt' })) @(
        @{ Key = 'Drive'; Label = 'Ziel'; Type = 'Combo'; Items = $items },
        @{ Key = 'App'; Label = 'Portable PC-Tools mitkopieren, falls noch nicht auf dem Ziel'; Type = 'Check'; Value = $true })
    if (-not $in) { return }
    $root = ''
    if ([string]$in.Drive -like 'Anderen*') { $root = Select-NdFolder 'Ziel wählen - dort wird PCPflege\Daten\Toolbox angelegt'; if (-not $root) { return } }
    else { $root = ([string]$in.Drive -split '\s+')[0] }
    $dst = Join-Path (Join-Path (Join-Path $root 'PCPflege') 'Daten') 'Toolbox'
    if ((Split-Path $root -Leaf) -eq 'PCPflege') { $dst = Join-Path (Join-Path $root 'Daten') 'Toolbox' }
    try { if ([IO.Path]::GetFullPath($dst).TrimEnd('\') -eq [IO.Path]::GetFullPath($src).TrimEnd('\')) { Show-UiError 'Die Toolbox liegt bereits an diesem Ort (PC-Tools läuft von diesem Stick).'; return } } catch { }
    if (-not (Confirm-Ui ("Toolbox nach`n{0}`nkopieren?" -f $dst))) { return }
    Start-Run -Parts @('ToolboxCopy') -Job @{ Target = $root; WithApp = [bool]$in.App }
}

# =====================================================================
#  SOFTWARE-KIOSK
# =====================================================================
function Get-KsUserFile { Join-Path $DataDir 'kiosk.json' }
function ConvertTo-KsRole($R, [switch]$NewKey) {
    $apps = @(foreach ($a in @($R.Apps)) {
        if ($null -eq $a) { continue }
        if ($a -is [string]) { $aid = $a; $anm = '' } else { $aid = [string]$a.Id; $anm = [string]$a.Name }
        if ($aid -match '^[\w\.\-\+]+$') { @{ Id = $aid; Name = $anm } }
    })
    $gl = 0xE77B
    try { if ($R.Glyph) { if ($R.Glyph -is [int] -or $R.Glyph -is [long]) { $gl = [int]$R.Glyph } else { $gl = [Convert]::ToInt32(([string]$R.Glyph -replace '^(0x|&#x)', '' -replace ';$', ''), 16) } } } catch { }
    $col = if ([string]$R.Color -match '^#[0-9A-Fa-f]{6}$') { [string]$R.Color } else { '#DB2777' }
    $key = if ($R.Key -and -not $NewKey) { [string]$R.Key } else { 'u' + [guid]::NewGuid().ToString('N').Substring(0, 8) }
    return @{ Key = $key; Name = ([string]$R.Name).Trim(); Desc = [string]$R.Desc; Glyph = $gl; Color = $col; Apps = $apps; Builtin = $false }
}
function Read-KsUserRoles {
    $f = Get-KsUserFile
    if (-not (Test-Path -LiteralPath $f)) { return @() }
    try {
        $j = Get-Content -LiteralPath $f -Raw -Encoding UTF8 | ConvertFrom-Json
        return @($j.Roles | Where-Object { $_ -and $_.Name } | ForEach-Object { ConvertTo-KsRole $_ })
    } catch { Show-UiError ('Die eigenen Rollen (kiosk.json) sind beschädigt und werden nicht angezeigt: {0}' -f $_.Exception.Message); return @() }
}
function ConvertTo-KsJsonRole($R) {
    [ordered]@{ Key = $R.Key; Name = $R.Name; Desc = $R.Desc; Glyph = ('{0:X4}' -f [int]$R.Glyph); Color = $R.Color
        Apps = @(foreach ($a in @($R.Apps)) { if ($a -is [string]) { $ap = Get-KsApp $a; [ordered]@{ Id = $ap.Id; Name = $ap.Name } } else { [ordered]@{ Id = [string]$a.Id; Name = [string]$a.Name } } }) }
}
function Save-KsUserRoles {
    try {
        $data = [ordered]@{ Format = 'PC-Tools-Kiosk'; Version = 1; Roles = @(foreach ($r in @($script:KsUserRoles)) { ConvertTo-KsJsonRole $r }) }
        ($data | ConvertTo-Json -Depth 6) | Set-Content -LiteralPath (Get-KsUserFile) -Encoding UTF8
        return $true
    } catch { Show-UiError ('Eigene Rollen konnten nicht gespeichert werden: {0}' -f $_.Exception.Message); return $false }
}
function Get-KsAllRoles { @($KsRoles) + @($script:KsUserRoles) }
function Get-KsRole([string]$Key) { if (-not $Key) { return $null }; Get-KsAllRoles | Where-Object { $_.Key -eq $Key } | Select-Object -First 1 }
function Test-KsUserRole($R) { return ($R -and $R.Builtin -eq $false) }
function Get-KsApp([string]$Id, [string]$Name = '') {
    $c = $KsCatalog | Where-Object { $_.Id -eq $Id } | Select-Object -First 1
    if ($c) { return [pscustomobject]@{ Id = $c.Id; Name = $c.Name; Cat = $c.Cat; Desc = $c.Desc; Arp = $c.Arp; Known = $true } }
    return [pscustomobject]@{ Id = $Id; Name = $(if ($Name) { $Name } else { $Id }); Cat = 'Weitere'; Desc = ('winget-Paket {0}' -f $Id); Arp = ''; Known = $false }
}
function Get-KsAppId($A) { if ($A -is [string]) { return $A }; return [string]$A.Id }
function Get-KsRoleApps($R) { @(foreach ($a in @($R.Apps)) { if ($null -eq $a) { continue }; if ($a -is [string]) { Get-KsApp $a } else { Get-KsApp ([string]$a.Id) ([string]$a.Name) } }) }
function Get-KsCatStyle([string]$Cat) { if ($KsCatStyle.ContainsKey($Cat)) { return $KsCatStyle[$Cat] }; return @(0xE719, '#52627A') }

# ---- Rollen-Kacheln
function New-KsRoleTile($R) {
    $apps = @(Get-KsRoleApps $R)
    $card = New-Object Windows.Controls.Border
    $card.Width = 300; $card.Height = 182; $card.Margin = '0,0,14,14'; $card.Padding = '16,14'; $card.CornerRadius = '14'; $card.Cursor = 'Hand'
    $card.Background = New-UiBrush 'White'; $card.BorderBrush = New-UiBrush '#E2E7F0'; $card.BorderThickness = '1'; $card.Effect = New-TbShadow
    $card.Tag = $R.Key; $card.ToolTip = ('{0}: {1}' -f $R.Name, $R.Desc)
    $g = New-Object Windows.Controls.Grid
    foreach ($h in 'Auto', 'Auto', 'Auto', '*') { $rd = New-Object Windows.Controls.RowDefinition; $rd.Height = $h; [void]$g.RowDefinitions.Add($rd) }
    $hd = New-Object Windows.Controls.Grid
    foreach ($w in 'Auto', '*', 'Auto') { $cd = New-Object Windows.Controls.ColumnDefinition; $cd.Width = $w; [void]$hd.ColumnDefinitions.Add($cd) }
    $bdg = New-TbBadge $R.Glyph $R.Color 46; $bdg.Margin = '0,0,12,0'
    $ns = New-Object Windows.Controls.StackPanel; $ns.VerticalAlignment = 'Center'; [Windows.Controls.Grid]::SetColumn($ns, 1)
    [void]$ns.Children.Add((New-TbText $R.Name 16 '#1F2A44' 'SemiBold' $false))
    $cnt = New-TbText ('{0} Programme' -f $apps.Count) 11.5 $R.Color 'SemiBold' $false; $cnt.Margin = '0,2,0,0'; [void]$ns.Children.Add($cnt)
    $ck = New-Object Windows.Controls.Border; $ck.Width = 22; $ck.Height = 22; $ck.CornerRadius = '11'; $ck.BorderThickness = '1.5'; $ck.BorderBrush = New-UiBrush '#C5CEDD'; $ck.Background = New-UiBrush 'White'; $ck.VerticalAlignment = 'Top'
    $cm = New-Object Windows.Controls.TextBlock; $cm.FontFamily = 'Segoe MDL2 Assets'; $cm.Text = [string][char]0xE73E; $cm.FontSize = 11; $cm.Foreground = New-UiBrush '#FFFFFF'; $cm.HorizontalAlignment = 'Center'; $cm.VerticalAlignment = 'Center'; $cm.Visibility = 'Hidden'
    $ck.Child = $cm; [Windows.Controls.Grid]::SetColumn($ck, 2)
    [void]$hd.Children.Add($bdg); [void]$hd.Children.Add($ns); [void]$hd.Children.Add($ck)
    $ds = New-TbText $R.Desc 12 '#6B7890'; $ds.Height = 34; $ds.TextTrimming = 'WordEllipsis'; $ds.Margin = '0,10,0,0'; [Windows.Controls.Grid]::SetRow($ds, 1)
    $chips = New-Object Windows.Controls.WrapPanel; $chips.Margin = '0,8,0,0'; $chips.MaxHeight = 50; $chips.ClipToBounds = $true; [Windows.Controls.Grid]::SetRow($chips, 2)
    if (Test-KsUserRole $R) { [void]$chips.Children.Add((New-TbChip 'Eigene Rolle' '#DB2777' '#FFEDD5')) }
    foreach ($a in ($apps | Select-Object -First 5)) { [void]$chips.Children.Add((New-TbChip $a.Name '#475569' '#EEF2F8')) }
    if ($apps.Count -gt 5) { [void]$chips.Children.Add((New-TbChip ('+{0}' -f ($apps.Count - 5)) '#475569' '#EEF2F8')) }
    foreach ($c in $hd, $ds, $chips) { [void]$g.Children.Add($c) }
    $card.Child = $g
    $card.Add_MouseLeftButtonUp({ param($sender, $e) Select-KsRole ([string]$sender.Tag) })
    $card.Add_MouseEnter({ param($sender, $e) if ([string]$sender.Tag -ne $script:KsRoleSel) { $sender.BorderBrush = New-UiBrush '#AFC4EA' } })
    $card.Add_MouseLeave({ param($sender, $e) if ([string]$sender.Tag -ne $script:KsRoleSel) { $sender.BorderBrush = New-UiBrush '#E2E7F0' } })
    return [pscustomobject]@{ Role = $R; Card = $card; Count = $cnt; Check = $ck; Mark = $cm; Apps = $apps }
}
function Build-KsRoles {
    $ui.KsRolePanel.Children.Clear(); $script:KsRoleTiles = @{}
    foreach ($r in (Get-KsAllRoles)) { $tile = New-KsRoleTile $r; $script:KsRoleTiles[$r.Key] = $tile; [void]$ui.KsRolePanel.Children.Add($tile.Card) }
    Update-KsRoleTiles
}
function Update-KsRoleTiles {
    foreach ($k in @($script:KsRoleTiles.Keys)) {
        $tile = $script:KsRoleTiles[$k]; $r = $tile.Role
        $on = ($k -eq $script:KsRoleSel)
        $tile.Card.BorderBrush = New-UiBrush $(if ($on) { $r.Color } else { '#E2E7F0' })
        $tile.Card.BorderThickness = $(if ($on) { '2' } else { '1' })
        $tile.Card.Background = New-UiBrush $(if ($on) { '#F5F9FF' } else { 'White' })
        $tile.Check.Background = New-UiBrush $(if ($on) { $r.Color } else { 'White' })
        $tile.Check.BorderBrush = New-UiBrush $(if ($on) { $r.Color } else { '#C5CEDD' })
        $tile.Mark.Visibility = $(if ($on) { 'Visible' } else { 'Hidden' })
        if ($script:KsState) {
            $ni = @($tile.Apps | Where-Object { (Test-KsInstalled $_.Id $_.Arp) -eq $true }).Count
            $tile.Count.Text = $(if ($ni -ge $tile.Apps.Count -and $tile.Apps.Count) { '{0} Programme - alle installiert' -f $tile.Apps.Count } else { '{0} Programme - {1} installiert, {2} fehlen' -f $tile.Apps.Count, $ni, ($tile.Apps.Count - $ni) })
        } else { $tile.Count.Text = ('{0} Programme' -f $tile.Apps.Count) }
    }
}
function Select-KsRole([string]$Key) {
    $script:KsRoleSel = $Key
    Update-KsRoleTiles
    Show-KsRoleApps
    Update-KsCatalog
}
# ---- Programmliste der gewählten Rolle
function Show-KsRoleApps {
    $r = Get-KsRole $script:KsRoleSel
    $old = @{}
    if ($script:KsItemsRole -eq $script:KsRoleSel) { foreach ($it in $script:KsItems) { $old[$it.Id] = [bool]$it.Check.IsChecked } }
    $ui.KsAppPanel.Children.Clear(); $script:KsItems.Clear(); $script:KsItemsRole = $script:KsRoleSel
    $user = Test-KsUserRole $r
    foreach ($b in 'BtnKsInstallSel', 'BtnKsInstallAll', 'BtnKsSelMissing', 'BtnKsSaveAs', 'BtnKsExport') { $ui[$b].IsEnabled = [bool]$r }
    $ui.BtnKsAddApp.IsEnabled = $user; $ui.BtnKsDelete.IsEnabled = $user
    $ui.BtnKsAddApp.ToolTip = $(if ($user) { 'Programm aus dem Katalog oder aus winget aufnehmen' } else { 'Nur bei eigenen Rollen - zuerst "Als eigene Rolle speichern"' })
    if (-not $r) {
        $ui.KsRoleTitle.Text = 'Bitte oben eine Rolle wählen'
        $ui.KsRoleDesc.Text = 'Ein Klick auf eine Rollen-Kachel zeigt ihre Programme. Fehlende Programme sind vorausgewählt.'
        $ui.KsRoleInfo.Text = ''; $ui.KsRoleBadge.Background = New-UiBrush '#52627A'; $ui.KsRoleGlyph.Text = [string][char]0xE719
        $ui.BtnKsInstallSel.Content = 'Ausgewählte installieren'
        return
    }
    $ui.KsRoleTitle.Text = $r.Name + $(if ($user) { '   (eigene Rolle)' } else { '' })
    $ui.KsRoleDesc.Text = $(if ($r.Desc) { $r.Desc } else { 'Eigene Rolle ohne Beschreibung.' })
    $ui.KsRoleBadge.Background = New-UiBrush $r.Color; $ui.KsRoleGlyph.Text = [string][char][int]$r.Glyph
    $apps = @(Get-KsRoleApps $r)
    if (-not $apps.Count) {
        $e = New-TbText 'Diese Rolle enthält noch keine Programme - mit "Programm hinzufügen ..." aus dem Katalog oder aus winget aufnehmen, oder unten im Katalog "+ Rolle" klicken.' 12.5 '#6B7890'; $e.Margin = '0,4,0,8'
        [void]$ui.KsAppPanel.Children.Add($e)
    }
    foreach ($a in $apps) {
        $inst = Test-KsInstalled $a.Id $a.Arp
        $sty = Get-KsCatStyle $a.Cat
        $bd = New-Object Windows.Controls.Border
        $bd.Width = 270; $bd.Margin = '0,0,10,10'; $bd.Padding = '10,8'; $bd.CornerRadius = '10'; $bd.Background = New-UiBrush '#F8FAFD'; $bd.BorderBrush = New-UiBrush '#E2E7F0'; $bd.BorderThickness = '1'
        $bd.ToolTip = ('{0}{3}{1}{3}winget-ID: {2}' -f $a.Name, $a.Desc, $a.Id, "`n")
        $gr = New-Object Windows.Controls.Grid
        foreach ($w in '*', 'Auto') { $cd = New-Object Windows.Controls.ColumnDefinition; $cd.Width = $w; [void]$gr.ColumnDefinitions.Add($cd) }
        $cb = New-Object Windows.Controls.CheckBox; $cb.VerticalContentAlignment = 'Center'
        $cb.IsChecked = $(if ($old.ContainsKey($a.Id)) { $old[$a.Id] } else { $inst -ne $true })
        $sp = New-Object Windows.Controls.StackPanel; $sp.Orientation = 'Horizontal'; $sp.Margin = '4,0,0,0'
        $bdg = New-TbBadge $sty[0] $sty[1] 30; $bdg.Margin = '0,0,10,0'; $bdg.VerticalAlignment = 'Center'
        $tx = New-Object Windows.Controls.StackPanel; $tx.Width = 172
        [void]$tx.Children.Add((New-TbText $a.Name 13 '#1F2A44' 'SemiBold' $false))
        $l2 = New-Object Windows.Controls.StackPanel; $l2.Orientation = 'Horizontal'; $l2.Margin = '0,3,0,0'
        if ($inst -eq $true) { [void]$l2.Children.Add((New-TbChip 'installiert' '#15803D' '#DCFCE7')) }
        elseif ($null -eq $inst) { [void]$l2.Children.Add((New-TbChip 'wird geprüft' '#6B7890' '#EEF2F8')) }
        else { [void]$l2.Children.Add((New-TbChip 'fehlt' '#C2410C' '#FFEDD5')) }
        $idt = New-TbText $a.Id 10.5 '#6B7890' 'Normal' $false; $idt.VerticalAlignment = 'Center'; $idt.MaxWidth = 110; [void]$l2.Children.Add($idt)
        [void]$tx.Children.Add($l2)
        [void]$sp.Children.Add($bdg); [void]$sp.Children.Add($tx)
        $cb.Content = $sp
        $cb.Add_Click({ Update-KsRoleInfo })
        [void]$gr.Children.Add($cb)
        if ($user) {
            $rm = New-TbButton '' $a.Id $false 0xE711; $rm.Padding = '6,3'; $rm.ToolTip = 'Aus dieser Rolle entfernen'; $rm.VerticalAlignment = 'Center'
            [Windows.Controls.Grid]::SetColumn($rm, 1)
            $rm.Add_Click({ param($sender, $e) Remove-KsRoleApp ([string]$sender.Tag) })
            [void]$gr.Children.Add($rm)
        }
        $bd.Child = $gr
        [void]$ui.KsAppPanel.Children.Add($bd)
        $script:KsItems.Add([pscustomobject]@{ Id = $a.Id; Name = $a.Name; Check = $cb; Installed = $inst })
    }
    Update-KsRoleInfo
}
function Update-KsRoleInfo {
    $r = Get-KsRole $script:KsRoleSel
    if (-not $r) { $ui.KsRoleInfo.Text = ''; return }
    $sel = @($script:KsItems | Where-Object { $_.Check.IsChecked }).Count
    $inst = @($script:KsItems | Where-Object { $_.Installed -eq $true }).Count
    $ui.KsRoleInfo.Text = $(if ($script:KsState) { '{0} Programme - {1} installiert - {2} ausgewählt' -f $script:KsItems.Count, $inst, $sel } else { '{0} Programme - {1} ausgewählt (Installationsstatus wird ermittelt ...)' -f $script:KsItems.Count, $sel })
    $ui.BtnKsInstallSel.Content = $(if ($sel) { 'Ausgewählte installieren ({0})' -f $sel } else { 'Ausgewählte installieren' })
}
function Install-KsIds([string[]]$Ids, [string]$Title, [bool]$Ask = $true) {
    $list = @($Ids | Where-Object { $_ } | Select-Object -Unique)
    if (-not $list.Count) { Show-UiError 'Bitte mindestens ein Programm auswählen.'; return }
    if ($script:Job) { Show-UiError 'Es läuft bereits eine Aufgabe - bitte warten, bis sie fertig ist (Fortschritt auf der Seite Protokoll).'; return }
    if (-not (Get-WingetPathX)) { Show-UiError 'winget (App-Installer) wurde nicht gefunden - bitte den App-Installer aus dem Microsoft Store installieren oder Windows aktualisieren.'; return }
    if ($Ask) {
        $names = @($list | ForEach-Object { $ap = Get-KsApp $_; $st = Test-KsInstalled $ap.Id $ap.Arp; '  - {0}{1}' -f $ap.Name, $(if ($st -eq $true) { '  (installiert - wird aktualisiert)' } else { '' }) })
        $msg = "{0}: {1} Programm(e) installieren?`n`n{2}`n`nDie Installation läuft still im Hintergrund über winget (Download direkt vom Hersteller). Laufende Programme bitte vorher schließen.{3}" -f $Title, $list.Count, ($names -join "`n"), $(if ($Script:IsPortable) { "`n`nHinweis: PC-Tools läuft vom Stick - die Programme werden auf DIESEM PC installiert." } else { '' })
        if ([Windows.MessageBox]::Show((T ($msg)), (T ('PC-Tools - Software-Kiosk')), 'YesNo', 'Question') -ne 'Yes') { return }
    }
    $script:KsJobWatch = $true
    Start-Run -Parts @('WingetInstall') -WingetApps $list
}
function Remove-KsRoleApp([string]$Id) {
    $r = Get-KsRole $script:KsRoleSel
    if (-not (Test-KsUserRole $r)) { return }
    $r.Apps = @($r.Apps | Where-Object { (Get-KsAppId $_) -ne $Id })
    if (Save-KsUserRoles) { $ui.StatusText.Text = ('{0} aus der Rolle "{1}" entfernt' -f $Id, $r.Name) }
    Build-KsRoles; Show-KsRoleApps; Update-KsCatalog; Update-KsHero
}
function Add-KsRoleApp([string]$Id, [string]$Name) {
    $r = Get-KsRole $script:KsRoleSel
    if (-not (Test-KsUserRole $r)) { Show-UiError 'Programme lassen sich nur in eigene Rollen aufnehmen - bitte zuerst eine eigene Rolle wählen oder anlegen ("Als eigene Rolle speichern" bzw. "Neue eigene Rolle").'; return }
    if (@($r.Apps | Where-Object { (Get-KsAppId $_) -eq $Id }).Count) { $ui.StatusText.Text = ('{0} ist bereits in der Rolle "{1}"' -f $Id, $r.Name); return }
    $r.Apps = @(@($r.Apps) + , @{ Id = $Id; Name = $Name })
    if (Save-KsUserRoles) { $ui.StatusText.Text = ('{0} in die Rolle "{1}" aufgenommen' -f $(if ($Name) { $Name } else { $Id }), $r.Name) }
    Build-KsRoles; Show-KsRoleApps; Update-KsCatalog; Update-KsHero
}
function New-KsUserRole([string]$Title, [string]$Intro, [string]$Name, [string]$Desc, $Source, [object[]]$Apps) {
    $in = Show-InputDialog $Title $Intro @(
        @{ Key = 'Name'; Label = 'Name der Rolle'; Type = 'Text'; Value = $Name },
        @{ Key = 'Desc'; Label = 'Beschreibung (optional)'; Type = 'Text'; Value = $Desc },
        @{ Key = 'Color'; Label = 'Farbe'; Type = 'Combo'; Items = @($KsColorNames.Keys) })
    if (-not $in) { return $null }
    $nm = ([string]$in.Name).Trim()
    if (-not $nm) { Show-UiError 'Bitte einen Namen eingeben.'; return $null }
    if (@(Get-KsAllRoles | Where-Object { $_.Name -eq $nm }).Count) { Show-UiError ('Eine Rolle "{0}" gibt es schon - bitte einen anderen Namen wählen.' -f $nm); return $null }
    $col = $KsColorNames[[string]$in.Color]
    if (-not $col) { $col = $(if ($Source) { $Source.Color } else { '#DB2777' }) }
    $new = @{ Key = 'u' + [guid]::NewGuid().ToString('N').Substring(0, 8); Name = $nm; Desc = [string]$in.Desc; Glyph = $(if ($Source) { [int]$Source.Glyph } else { 0xE77B }); Color = $col; Apps = @($Apps); Builtin = $false }
    $script:KsUserRoles = @(@($script:KsUserRoles) + , $new)
    if (-not (Save-KsUserRoles)) { return $null }
    return $new
}
function Save-KsRoleAs {
    $r = Get-KsRole $script:KsRoleSel; if (-not $r) { return }
    $sel = @($script:KsItems | Where-Object { $_.Check.IsChecked })
    if (-not $sel.Count) { Show-UiError 'Bitte die Programme anhaken, die in die neue Rolle sollen (z.B. mit "Alle der Rolle" oder einzeln).'; return }
    $apps = @(foreach ($it in $sel) { @{ Id = $it.Id; Name = $it.Name } })
    $new = New-KsUserRole 'Als eigene Rolle speichern' ("Gespeichert werden die {0} angehakten Programme. Die eigene Rolle lässt sich danach frei bearbeiten (Programme hinzufügen/entfernen), exportieren und auf anderen PCs importieren." -f $sel.Count) ($r.Name + ' (eigene)') $r.Desc $r $apps
    if ($new) { Build-KsRoles; Select-KsRole $new.Key; Update-KsHero; $ui.StatusText.Text = ('Rolle "{0}" gespeichert' -f $new.Name) }
}
function Remove-KsRole {
    $r = Get-KsRole $script:KsRoleSel
    if (-not (Test-KsUserRole $r)) { return }
    if (-not (Confirm-Ui ("Die eigene Rolle ""{0}"" ({1} Programme) löschen?`n`nInstallierte Programme bleiben unberührt. Tipp: vorher ""Rolle exportieren"", um sie später wieder importieren zu können." -f $r.Name, @($r.Apps).Count) 'Warning')) { return }
    $script:KsUserRoles = @($script:KsUserRoles | Where-Object { $_.Key -ne $r.Key })
    [void](Save-KsUserRoles)
    $script:KsRoleSel = ''
    Build-KsRoles; Show-KsRoleApps; Update-KsCatalog; Update-KsHero
    $ui.StatusText.Text = ('Rolle "{0}" gelöscht' -f $r.Name)
}
function Export-KsRole {
    $r = Get-KsRole $script:KsRoleSel; if (-not $r) { return }
    $d = New-Object Microsoft.Win32.SaveFileDialog
    $d.Filter = 'Kiosk-Rolle (*.json)|*.json'; $d.FileName = ('Kiosk-Rolle {0}.json' -f ($r.Name -replace '[\\/:*?"<>|]', '-')); $d.Title = 'Rolle exportieren'
    if (-not $d.ShowDialog()) { return }
    try {
        $one = ConvertTo-KsJsonRole $r
        ([ordered]@{ Format = 'PC-Tools-Kiosk'; Version = 1; Exported = (Get-Date).ToString('s'); Computer = $env:COMPUTERNAME; Roles = @(, $one) } | ConvertTo-Json -Depth 6) | Set-Content -LiteralPath $d.FileName -Encoding UTF8
        $ui.StatusText.Text = ('Rolle exportiert: {0}' -f $d.FileName)
    } catch { Show-UiError ('Export fehlgeschlagen: {0}' -f $_.Exception.Message) }
}
function Import-KsRole {
    $d = New-Object Microsoft.Win32.OpenFileDialog
    $d.Filter = 'Kiosk-Rolle (*.json)|*.json|Alle Dateien (*.*)|*.*'; $d.Title = 'Rolle importieren'
    if (-not $d.ShowDialog()) { return }
    try {
        $j = Get-Content -LiteralPath $d.FileName -Raw -Encoding UTF8 | ConvertFrom-Json
        $src = if ($j.Roles) { @($j.Roles) } elseif ($j.Name) { @($j) } else { @() }
        $new = @(foreach ($x in $src) { if ($x -and $x.Name) { ConvertTo-KsRole $x -NewKey } })
        if (-not $new.Count) { Show-UiError 'Die Datei enthält keine Kiosk-Rolle.'; return }
        foreach ($n in $new) {
            $base = $n.Name; $i = 1
            while (@(Get-KsAllRoles | Where-Object { $_.Name -eq $n.Name }).Count) { $i++; $n.Name = $(if ($i -eq 2) { $base + ' (importiert)' } else { '{0} (importiert {1})' -f $base, $i }) }
            $script:KsUserRoles = @(@($script:KsUserRoles) + , $n)
        }
        if (Save-KsUserRoles) {
            Build-KsRoles; Select-KsRole $new[0].Key; Update-KsHero
            $ui.StatusText.Text = ('{0} Rolle(n) importiert: {1}' -f $new.Count, (($new | ForEach-Object { '{0} ({1} Programme)' -f $_.Name, @($_.Apps).Count }) -join ', '))
        }
    } catch { Show-UiError ('Import fehlgeschlagen - keine gültige Kiosk-Datei: {0}' -f $_.Exception.Message) }
}

# ---- Katalog "Einzelne Programme"
function Build-KsCatalog {
    $ui.KsCatPanel.Children.Clear(); $script:KsCatTiles.Clear()
    foreach ($c in $KsCatalog) {
        $a = Get-KsApp $c.Id
        $sty = Get-KsCatStyle $a.Cat
        $card = New-Object Windows.Controls.Border
        $card.Width = 246; $card.Height = 150; $card.Margin = '0,0,12,12'; $card.Padding = '14,12'; $card.CornerRadius = '12'
        $card.Background = New-UiBrush 'White'; $card.BorderBrush = New-UiBrush '#E2E7F0'; $card.BorderThickness = '1'
        $card.ToolTip = ('{0}{3}{1}{3}winget-ID: {2}' -f $a.Name, $a.Desc, $a.Id, "`n")
        $g = New-Object Windows.Controls.Grid
        foreach ($h in 'Auto', '*', 'Auto') { $rd = New-Object Windows.Controls.RowDefinition; $rd.Height = $h; [void]$g.RowDefinitions.Add($rd) }
        $hd = New-Object Windows.Controls.StackPanel; $hd.Orientation = 'Horizontal'
        $bdg = New-TbBadge $sty[0] $sty[1] 34; $bdg.Margin = '0,0,10,0'
        $ns = New-Object Windows.Controls.StackPanel; $ns.Width = 170; $ns.VerticalAlignment = 'Center'
        [void]$ns.Children.Add((New-TbText $a.Name 13.5 '#1F2A44' 'SemiBold' $false))
        [void]$ns.Children.Add((New-TbText $a.Cat 11 $sty[1] 'SemiBold' $false))
        [void]$hd.Children.Add($bdg); [void]$hd.Children.Add($ns)
        $ds = New-TbText $a.Desc 11.5 '#6B7890'; $ds.TextTrimming = 'WordEllipsis'; $ds.Margin = '0,8,0,6'; [Windows.Controls.Grid]::SetRow($ds, 1)
        $bg = New-Object Windows.Controls.Grid; [Windows.Controls.Grid]::SetRow($bg, 2)
        foreach ($w in '*', 'Auto', 'Auto') { $cd = New-Object Windows.Controls.ColumnDefinition; $cd.Width = $w; [void]$bg.ColumnDefinitions.Add($cd) }
        $stp = New-Object Windows.Controls.StackPanel; $stp.Orientation = 'Horizontal'; $stp.VerticalAlignment = 'Center'
        $dot = New-Object Windows.Shapes.Ellipse; $dot.Width = 8; $dot.Height = 8; $dot.Fill = New-UiBrush '#9AA5B8'; $dot.Margin = '0,0,6,0'; $dot.VerticalAlignment = 'Center'
        $stt = New-TbText '...' 11.5 '#6B7890' 'Normal' $false; $stt.VerticalAlignment = 'Center'
        [void]$stp.Children.Add($dot); [void]$stp.Children.Add($stt)
        $ba = New-TbButton 'Rolle' $a.Id $false 0xE710; $ba.Padding = '7,4'; $ba.Margin = '0,0,6,0'; $ba.ToolTip = 'In die gewählte eigene Rolle aufnehmen'; [Windows.Controls.Grid]::SetColumn($ba, 1)
        $bi = New-TbButton 'Installieren' $a.Id $true 0xE896; $bi.Padding = '9,4'; [Windows.Controls.Grid]::SetColumn($bi, 2)
        $ba.Add_Click({ param($sender, $e) $ap = Get-KsApp ([string]$sender.Tag); Add-KsRoleApp $ap.Id $ap.Name })
        $bi.Add_Click({ param($sender, $e) $ap = Get-KsApp ([string]$sender.Tag); Install-KsIds @($ap.Id) $ap.Name })
        [void]$bg.Children.Add($stp); [void]$bg.Children.Add($ba); [void]$bg.Children.Add($bi)
        foreach ($x in $hd, $ds, $bg) { [void]$g.Children.Add($x) }
        $card.Child = $g
        $card.Add_MouseEnter({ param($sender, $e) $sender.BorderBrush = New-UiBrush '#AFC4EA' })
        $card.Add_MouseLeave({ param($sender, $e) $sender.BorderBrush = New-UiBrush '#E2E7F0' })
        [void]$ui.KsCatPanel.Children.Add($card)
        $script:KsCatTiles.Add([pscustomobject]@{ App = $a; Card = $card; Dot = $dot; Status = $stt; Add = $ba; Inst = $bi })
    }
}
function Update-KsCatalog {
    if (-not $script:KsBuilt) { return }
    $r = Get-KsRole $script:KsRoleSel
    $user = Test-KsUserRole $r
    $inRole = @{}; if ($r) { foreach ($x in @($r.Apps)) { $inRole[(Get-KsAppId $x)] = $true } }
    foreach ($tile in $script:KsCatTiles) {
        $a = $tile.App
        $inst = Test-KsInstalled $a.Id $a.Arp
        if ($inst -eq $true) { $tile.Status.Text = 'installiert'; $tile.Dot.Fill = New-UiBrush '#16A34A'; $tile.Inst.Content.Children[1].Text = 'Aktualisieren'; Set-TbButtonPrimary $tile.Inst $false }
        elseif ($null -eq $inst) { $tile.Status.Text = '...'; $tile.Dot.Fill = New-UiBrush '#9AA5B8'; $tile.Inst.Content.Children[1].Text = 'Installieren'; Set-TbButtonPrimary $tile.Inst $true }
        else { $tile.Status.Text = 'nicht installiert'; $tile.Dot.Fill = New-UiBrush '#9AA5B8'; $tile.Inst.Content.Children[1].Text = 'Installieren'; Set-TbButtonPrimary $tile.Inst $true }
        $tile.Add.IsEnabled = $user -and -not $inRole.ContainsKey($a.Id)
        $tile.Add.ToolTip = $(if (-not $user) { 'Zuerst oben eine eigene Rolle wählen oder anlegen' } elseif ($inRole.ContainsKey($a.Id)) { ('Schon in der Rolle "{0}"' -f $r.Name) } else { ('In die Rolle "{0}" aufnehmen' -f $r.Name) })
    }
    Update-KsCatalogFilter
}
function Update-KsCatalogFilter {
    if (-not $script:KsBuilt) { return }
    $catSel = if ($ui.KsCat.SelectedIndex -gt 0) { [string]$ui.KsCat.SelectedItem.Content } else { '' }
    $q = $ui.KsSearch.Text.Trim()
    $n = 0
    foreach ($tile in $script:KsCatTiles) {
        $a = $tile.App
        $show = ((-not $catSel) -or ($a.Cat -eq $catSel)) -and ((-not $q) -or (Test-Match $a $q @('Name', 'Id', 'Desc', 'Cat')))
        $tile.Card.Visibility = $(if ($show) { 'Visible' } else { 'Collapsed' })
        if ($show) { $n++ }
    }
    if (-not $script:KsScanBusy) {
        $st = $script:KsState
        $ui.KsStatus.Text = $(if ($st) { '{0} von {1} Programmen angezeigt - Stand der Installationserkennung: {2:HH:mm} Uhr{3}' -f $n, $script:KsCatTiles.Count, $st.Time, $(if (-not $st.Winget) { ' (winget nicht verfügbar - Erkennung nur über "Programme und Features")' } else { '' }) } else { '{0} von {1} Programmen angezeigt' -f $n, $script:KsCatTiles.Count })
    }
}
function Update-KsHero {
    if (-not $script:KsBuilt) { return }
    $nu = @($script:KsUserRoles).Count
    $ui.KsHeroRoles.Text = ('{0} Rollen{1}' -f @($KsRoles).Count, $(if ($nu) { ' + {0} eigene' -f $nu } else { '' }))
    $ui.KsHeroApps.Text = ('{0} Programme im Katalog' -f @($KsCatalog).Count)
    if ($script:KsState) {
        $ni = @($KsCatalog | Where-Object { (Test-KsInstalled $_.Id $_.Arp) -eq $true }).Count
        $ui.KsHeroInst.Text = ('{0} davon auf diesem PC installiert' -f $ni)
    } else { $ui.KsHeroInst.Text = 'Installationsstatus wird ermittelt ...' }
}
function Update-KsAll {
    if (-not $script:KsBuilt) { return }
    Update-KsRoleTiles
    $script:KsItemsRole = ''   # neuer Stand: Häkchen neu setzen (fehlende Programme vorausgewählt)
    Show-KsRoleApps
    Update-KsCatalog
    Update-KsHero
}

# ---- winget-Suche (Dialog)
function ConvertFrom-KsWingetTable([string]$Text) {
    $lines = @(($Text -split "`n") | ForEach-Object { $l = ([string]$_).TrimEnd("`r"); (($l -split "`r")[-1]).TrimEnd() })
    $hdr = -1
    for ($i = 0; $i -lt $lines.Count - 1; $i++) { if ($lines[$i] -match '^\s*Name\s+ID\s+Version' -and $lines[$i + 1] -match '^-{10,}') { $hdr = $i; break } }
    if ($hdr -lt 0) { return @() }
    $h = $lines[$hdr]
    $cId = [regex]::Match($h, '(?<=\s)ID(?=\s)', 'IgnoreCase').Index
    $cVer = [regex]::Match($h, '(?<=\s)Version(?=\s|$)', 'IgnoreCase').Index
    $srcM = [regex]::Match($h, '(?<=\s)(Quelle|Source)\s*$', 'IgnoreCase')
    $cSrc = if ($srcM.Success) { $srcM.Index } else { -1 }
    $out = [System.Collections.Generic.List[object]]::new()
    for ($i = $hdr + 2; $i -lt $lines.Count; $i++) {
        $l = $lines[$i]
        if (-not $l.Trim() -or $l.Length -le $cVer) { continue }
        if ($l[$cId - 1] -ne ' ') { continue }
        $name = $l.Substring(0, $cId).Trim()
        $id = ($l.Substring($cId).Trim() -split '\s+')[0]
        $ver = ($l.Substring($cVer).Trim() -split '\s+')[0]
        $src = if ($cSrc -gt 0 -and $l.Length -gt $cSrc) { $l.Substring($cSrc).Trim() } else { 'winget' }
        if ($id -match '^[\w\.\-\+]+$' -and $name) { $out.Add([pscustomobject]@{ Name = $name; Id = $id; Version = $ver; Source = $src }) }
    }
    return $out.ToArray()
}
function Get-KsWingetSearch([string]$Wg, [string]$Query) {
    $psi = New-Object Diagnostics.ProcessStartInfo
    $psi.FileName = $Wg
    $psi.Arguments = ('search --query "{0}" --source winget --count 80 --accept-source-agreements --disable-interactivity' -f ($Query -replace '"', ''))
    $psi.UseShellExecute = $false; $psi.CreateNoWindow = $true; $psi.RedirectStandardOutput = $true; $psi.RedirectStandardError = $true
    $psi.StandardOutputEncoding = [Text.Encoding]::UTF8
    $p = [Diagnostics.Process]::Start($psi)
    $o = $p.StandardOutput.ReadToEndAsync(); $null = $p.StandardError.ReadToEndAsync()
    if (-not $p.WaitForExit(90000)) { try { $p.Kill() } catch { }; throw 'winget antwortet nicht (Zeitüberschreitung nach 90 Sekunden).' }
    $p.WaitForExit()
    return (ConvertFrom-KsWingetTable $o.Result)
}
function Start-KsDlgSearch {
    $d = $script:KsDlg; if (-not $d) { return }
    $q = $d.Win.FindName('Q').Text.Trim()
    if ($q.Length -lt 2) { $d.Hint.Text = 'Bitte mindestens 2 Zeichen eingeben.'; return }
    $pat = '*' + [Management.Automation.WildcardPattern]::Escape($q) + '*'
    $loc = @($KsCatalog | Where-Object { $_.Name -like $pat -or $_.Id -like $pat -or $_.Desc -like $pat } | ForEach-Object { [pscustomobject]@{ Name = $_.Name; Id = $_.Id; Version = ''; Source = 'Katalog' } })
    $d.Local = $loc
    Set-GridItems $d.Grid $loc
    $wg = Get-WingetPathX
    if (-not $wg) { $d.Hint.Text = ('{0} Treffer im Katalog - winget wurde nicht gefunden, daher keine Online-Suche.' -f $loc.Count); return }
    $d.Hint.Text = ('{0} Treffer im Katalog - suche in winget nach "{1}" ...' -f $loc.Count, $q); $d.Go.IsEnabled = $false
    Invoke-Bg -Script { param($w, $s) Get-KsWingetSearch $w $s } -Arguments @($wg, $q) -Functions @('Get-KsWingetSearch', 'ConvertFrom-KsWingetTable') -Done {
        param($r, $err)
        $dd = $script:KsDlg; if (-not $dd) { return }
        $dd.Go.IsEnabled = $true
        if ($err) { $dd.Hint.Text = 'winget-Suche fehlgeschlagen: ' + $err.Message; return }
        $have = @{}; foreach ($x in @($dd.Local)) { $have[$x.Id] = $true }
        $more = @($r | Where-Object { $_ -and $_.PSObject.Properties['Id'] -and -not $have.ContainsKey($_.Id) })
        Set-GridItems $dd.Grid (@($dd.Local) + $more)
        $dd.Hint.Text = ('{0} Treffer ({1} aus dem Katalog, {2} aus winget). Zeile markieren und "Übernehmen" - oder doppelklicken.' -f (@($dd.Local).Count + $more.Count), @($dd.Local).Count, $more.Count)
    }
}
function Show-KsWingetSearch([string]$Intro) {
    $x = @"
<Window xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation" xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
        Title="Programm suchen (Katalog und winget)" Width="780" Height="580" MinWidth="560" MinHeight="400" WindowStartupLocation="CenterOwner" FontFamily="Segoe UI" FontSize="13" Background="#F4F6FA">
  <Grid Margin="18">
    <Grid.RowDefinitions><RowDefinition Height="Auto"/><RowDefinition Height="Auto"/><RowDefinition Height="*"/><RowDefinition Height="Auto"/><RowDefinition Height="Auto"/></Grid.RowDefinitions>
    <TextBlock Text="$(Esc $Intro)" TextWrapping="Wrap" Foreground="#1F2A44"/>
    <Grid Grid.Row="1" Margin="0,12,0,10">
      <Grid.ColumnDefinitions><ColumnDefinition Width="*"/><ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/></Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
      <TextBox x:Name="Q" Padding="6,5" VerticalContentAlignment="Center"/>
      <Button x:Name="Go" Grid.Column="1" Content="Suchen" IsDefault="True" Padding="18,5" Margin="8,0,0,0"/>
    </Grid>
    <DataGrid x:Name="Res" Grid.Row="2" AutoGenerateColumns="False" IsReadOnly="True" SelectionMode="Single" HeadersVisibility="Column" GridLinesVisibility="None" Background="White" BorderBrush="#E2E7F0" RowHeight="26" CanUserAddRows="False">
      <DataGrid.Columns>
        <DataGridTextColumn Header="Name" Binding="{Binding Name}" Width="*"/>
        <DataGridTextColumn Header="Paket-ID" Binding="{Binding Id}" Width="250"/>
        <DataGridTextColumn Header="Version" Binding="{Binding Version}" Width="100"/>
        <DataGridTextColumn Header="Quelle" Binding="{Binding Source}" Width="80"/>
      </DataGrid.Columns>
    </DataGrid>
    <TextBlock x:Name="Hint" Grid.Row="3" Text="Suchbegriff eingeben, z.B. &quot;pdf&quot;, &quot;notepad&quot; oder &quot;vpn&quot; - der Katalog antwortet sofort, winget nach einigen Sekunden." Foreground="#6B7890" FontSize="12" TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,8,0,0"/>
    <Grid Grid.Row="4" Margin="0,14,0,0">
      <Grid.ColumnDefinitions><ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/><ColumnDefinition Width="*"/><ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/><ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/></Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
      <TextBlock Text="oder Paket-ID direkt:" VerticalAlignment="Center" Foreground="#6B7890" Margin="0,0,8,0"/>
      <TextBox x:Name="IdBox" Grid.Column="1" Padding="6,4" VerticalContentAlignment="Center" MaxWidth="320" HorizontalAlignment="Left" MinWidth="200"/>
      <Button x:Name="Ok" Grid.Column="2" Content="Übernehmen" Width="120" Padding="0,7" Margin="12,0,8,0"/>
      <Button x:Name="No" Grid.Column="3" Content="Abbrechen" Width="100" Padding="0,7" IsCancel="True"/>
    </Grid>
  </Grid>
</Window>
"@
    $w = [Windows.Markup.XamlReader]::Parse($x)
    $w.Owner = $window
    $script:KsDlg = @{ Win = $w; Grid = $w.FindName('Res'); Hint = $w.FindName('Hint'); Go = $w.FindName('Go'); Result = $null; Local = @() }
    $w.FindName('Go').Add_Click({ Start-KsDlgSearch })
    $w.FindName('Ok').Add_Click({ Complete-KsDlg })
    $w.FindName('Res').Add_MouseDoubleClick({ if ($script:KsDlg -and $script:KsDlg.Grid.SelectedItem) { Complete-KsDlg } })
    $w.Add_ContentRendered({ if ($script:KsDlg) { [void]$script:KsDlg.Win.FindName('Q').Focus() } })
    $null = $w.ShowDialog()
    $res = $null; if ($script:KsDlg) { $res = $script:KsDlg.Result }
    $script:KsDlg = $null
    return $res
}
function Complete-KsDlg {
    $d = $script:KsDlg; if (-not $d) { return }
    $id = $d.Win.FindName('IdBox').Text.Trim()
    $sel = $d.Grid.SelectedItem
    if ($id) {
        if ($id -notmatch '^[\w\.\-\+]+$') { Show-UiError 'Ungültige Paket-ID - erlaubt sind Buchstaben, Ziffern, Punkt, Minus, Plus und Unterstrich (z.B. Mozilla.Firefox).'; return }
        $d.Result = [pscustomobject]@{ Id = $id; Name = (Get-KsApp $id).Name }
    } elseif ($sel) { $d.Result = [pscustomobject]@{ Id = [string]$sel.Id; Name = [string]$sel.Name } }
    else { Show-UiError 'Bitte ein Programm in der Liste markieren oder eine Paket-ID eintragen.'; return }
    $d.Win.DialogResult = $true
}

# ---- Seiten einrichten
function Initialize-TbPage {
    Read-TbUpdateCache
    Build-TbTiles
    Update-TbView
    Start-TbSizeScan
    if (-not $script:KsState) { Start-KsStateScan }
}
function Initialize-KsPage {
    $script:KsUserRoles = @(Read-KsUserRoles)
    Build-KsRoles
    Build-KsCatalog
    $script:KsBuilt = $true
    Show-KsRoleApps
    Update-KsCatalog
    Update-KsHero
    if (-not $script:KsState) { Start-KsStateScan }
}

# ---- Ereignisse
$ui.Tabs.Add_SelectionChanged({
    param($s, $e)
    if ($e.OriginalSource -ne $s) { return }
    if ($s.SelectedItem -eq $ui.TabToolbox -and -not $script:TbBuilt) { try { Initialize-TbPage } catch { $ui.StatusText.Text = 'Toolbox: ' + $_.Exception.Message } }
    if ($s.SelectedItem -eq $ui.TabKiosk -and -not $script:KsBuilt) { try { Initialize-KsPage } catch { $ui.StatusText.Text = 'Software-Kiosk: ' + $_.Exception.Message } }
})
$ui.TbCat.Add_SelectionChanged({ Update-TbFilter })
$ui.TbSearch.Add_TextChanged({ Update-TbFilter })
$ui.BtnTbLoadAll.Add_Click({ try { Start-TbLoadAll } catch { Show-UiError $_.Exception.Message } })
$ui.BtnTbCheck.Add_Click({ try { Start-TbUpdateCheck } catch { $script:TbChecking = $false; $ui.BtnTbCheck.IsEnabled = $true; Show-UiError $_.Exception.Message } })
$ui.BtnTbUsb.Add_Click({ try { Start-TbUsbCopy } catch { Show-UiError $_.Exception.Message } })
$ui.BtnTbOpen.Add_Click({ try { $d = Get-TbDir; New-Item -Path $d -ItemType Directory -Force | Out-Null; Start-Process explorer.exe ('"{0}"' -f $d) } catch { Show-UiError $_.Exception.Message } })

$ui.KsCat.Add_SelectionChanged({ Update-KsCatalogFilter })
$ui.KsSearch.Add_TextChanged({ Update-KsCatalogFilter })
$ui.BtnKsRefresh.Add_Click({ Start-KsStateScan })
$ui.BtnKsSelMissing.Add_Click({ foreach ($it in $script:KsItems) { $it.Check.IsChecked = ($it.Installed -ne $true) }; Update-KsRoleInfo })
$ui.BtnKsInstallSel.Add_Click({
    $r = Get-KsRole $script:KsRoleSel; if (-not $r) { return }
    Install-KsIds @($script:KsItems | Where-Object { $_.Check.IsChecked } | ForEach-Object { $_.Id }) ('Rolle "{0}"' -f $r.Name)
})
$ui.BtnKsInstallAll.Add_Click({
    $r = Get-KsRole $script:KsRoleSel; if (-not $r) { return }
    Install-KsIds @($script:KsItems | ForEach-Object { $_.Id }) ('Rolle "{0}" komplett' -f $r.Name)
})
$ui.BtnKsSaveAs.Add_Click({ try { Save-KsRoleAs } catch { Show-UiError $_.Exception.Message } })
$ui.BtnKsDelete.Add_Click({ try { Remove-KsRole } catch { Show-UiError $_.Exception.Message } })
$ui.BtnKsExport.Add_Click({ Export-KsRole })
$ui.BtnKsImport.Add_Click({ Import-KsRole })
$ui.BtnKsNewRole.Add_Click({
    try {
        $new = New-KsUserRole 'Neue eigene Rolle' 'Eine leere Rolle anlegen. Programme kommen danach über "Programm hinzufügen ..." oder "+ Rolle" im Katalog dazu.' '' '' $null @()
        if ($new) { Build-KsRoles; Select-KsRole $new.Key; Update-KsHero }
    } catch { Show-UiError $_.Exception.Message }
})
$ui.BtnKsAddApp.Add_Click({
    $r = Get-KsRole $script:KsRoleSel
    if (-not (Test-KsUserRole $r)) { Show-UiError 'Programme lassen sich nur in eigene Rollen aufnehmen - bitte zuerst "Als eigene Rolle speichern".'; return }
    $sel = Show-KsWingetSearch ('Programm für die Rolle "{0}" suchen - im Katalog von PC-Tools und in allen winget-Paketen.' -f $r.Name)
    if ($sel) { Add-KsRoleApp $sel.Id $sel.Name }
})
$ui.BtnKsWgSearch.Add_Click({
    $sel = Show-KsWingetSearch 'Beliebiges Programm suchen - im Katalog von PC-Tools und in allen winget-Paketen. Die Installation läuft wie bei den Rollen still im Hintergrund.'
    if (-not $sel) { return }
    $r = Get-KsRole $script:KsRoleSel
    if (Test-KsUserRole $r) {
        $ans = [Windows.MessageBox]::Show((T (("{0} ({1})`n`nJa = jetzt installieren`nNein = in die Rolle ""{2}"" aufnehmen" -f $sel.Name, $sel.Id, $r.Name))), (T ('PC-Tools - Software-Kiosk')), 'YesNoCancel', 'Question')
        if ($ans -eq 'Yes') { Install-KsIds @($sel.Id) $sel.Name $false } elseif ($ans -eq 'No') { Add-KsRoleApp $sel.Id $sel.Name }
    } else { Install-KsIds @($sel.Id) $sel.Name }
})
# Nach einem Toolbox- oder Kiosk-Lauf Status neu einlesen
$script:TbKsTimer = New-Object System.Windows.Threading.DispatcherTimer
$script:TbKsTimer.Interval = [TimeSpan]::FromSeconds(2)
$script:TbKsTimer.Add_Tick({
    if ($script:Job) { return }
    if ($script:TbJobWatch) {
        $script:TbJobWatch = $false
        try { Update-TbView; Start-TbSizeScan } catch { }
        Start-KsStateScan
    }
    if ($script:KsJobWatch) { $script:KsJobWatch = $false; Start-KsStateScan }
})
$script:TbKsTimer.Start()

